SET OPERATORS
-----------------

1.UNION
---------
-->Combines results from two queries and remove duplicate rows.
columns must have the same number and type

2.UNION ALL
------------
-->Combines results from two queries, including duplicate duplicate
columns must have the same number and type

3.INTERSET
-----------
-->Returns rows that are common to both queries
columns must have same number and type

note: MySQL doesn't support intersect directly

4.MINUS
--------
-->Returns rows from the first query that are not present in the second
query columns must have the same number and type

note: MySQL doesn't support minus directly


